63
00:03:01,780 --> 00:03:03,443
This one is pharmacology.

64
00:03:03,674 --> 00:03:04,969
Question 2 of 3.

65
00:03:05,691 --> 00:03:08,763
A 42-year-old man is found unresponsive after

66
00:03:08,783 --> 00:03:12,950
taking “pain pills.” Vitals show RR 6/min, O2

67
00:03:12,970 --> 00:03:18,264
