128
00:06:12,852 --> 00:06:15,700
Naloxone reverses opioid toxicity by

129
00:06:15,720 --> 00:06:19,107
competitively antagonizing μ-opioid receptors,

130
00:06:19,260 --> 00:06:21,740
rapidly restoring respiration when the receptor

131
00:06:21,760 --> 00:06:22,713
